{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a5ef7aad-5314-485b-b5f8-658f485658d4",
    "name": "Growth Studio API",
    "description": "AI Content & Trend Intelligence Platform — REST API. Multi-team, role-based (user < admin < super_admin): admins manage teams/users/credentials across every team; super_admin additionally curates the dynamic Platform Catalog (which social platforms exist at all, system-wide); regular users only see their own team(s) data. Run \"Login as Admin\", \"Login as Super Admin\", or \"Login as Team User\" first — the super_admin account is auto-seeded on server boot from `.env` (`SUPER_ADMIN_EMAIL`/`SUPER_ADMIN_PASSWORD`), no setup needed. The {{token}} collection variable is set automatically from whichever login response ran last, and used as the bearer token on every other request. Suggested run order for a full demo: Login as Super Admin → Platform Catalog (create + enable platforms) → Login as Admin → Teams (create team + user) → Team Platforms (enable for the team) → Platform Credentials (add a token) → everything else.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "39338033"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
